nce</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody data-start=\"390\" data-end=\"1196\">\n<tr data-start=\"390\" data-end=\"500\">\n<td data-start=\"390\" data-end=\"422\" data-col-size=\"md\">Adequate cellularity</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"422\" data-end=\"500\">Sample has enough cells for reliable microscopic evaluation.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-start=\"501\" data-end=\"612\">\n<td data-start=\"501\" data-end=\"533\" data-col-size=\"md\">Inadequate cellularity</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"533\" data-end=\"612\">Sample has too few cells; may need repeat sampling for accurate diagnosis.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-start=\"613\" data-end=\"726\">\n<td data-start=\"613\" data-end=\"647\" data-col-size=\"md\">Presence of malignant cells</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"647\" data-end=\"726\">Cancer cells detected; indicates malignancy in the sampled fluid/tissue.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"839\">\n<td data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"760\" data-col-size=\"md\">Absence of malignant cells</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"760\" data-end=\"839\">No cancer cells found; may indicate benign or inflammatory condition.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-start=\"840\" data-end=\"951\">\n<td data-start=\"840\" data-end=\"873\" data-col-size=\"md\">Inflammatory cells present</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"951\">Suggests infection, inflammation, or reactive process.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"1070\">\n<td data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"989\" data-col-size=\"md\">Specific cell types identified</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1070\">Helps in diagnosing specific diseases (e.g., mesothelial cells, lymphocytes).</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-start=\"1071\" data-end=\"1196\">\n<td data-start=\"1071\" data-end=\"1119\" data-col-size=\"md\">Other findings (e.g., necrosis, fibrosis)</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1119\" data-end=\"1196\">Provides clues about disease processes or chronicity.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"sticky end-(--thread-content-margin) h-0 self-end select-none\">\n<div class=\"absolute end-0 flex items-end\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
